# Store text with LF, so a clone on any platform sees the same bytes.
#
# This is convenience, not a guarantee: the release manifest reads its digests
# from the git objects a tag identifies, precisely so that no checkout setting
# can change the answer. If this file disappeared, the manifest would still be
# reproducible -- it would just be easier for a human to be surprised by a diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.svg text eol=lf
